questions.solution:
Given, Damping force $\propto$ velocity
$\begin{aligned}
& F \propto y \\
& F=k v \\
& k=\frac{F}{v}
\end{aligned} \begin{aligned}
\text{Unit$ of $} k & =\frac{\text{ unit of } F}{\text{ unit of } v} \\
& =\frac{\mathrm{kg}-\mathrm{ms}^{-2}}{\mathrm{ ms}^{-1}}=\mathrm{kgs}^{-1}
\end{aligned}$

